{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065498/block/singleImage/3276811/df/01M86JT5R52S2HHJANDEWNRSP2.jpg?updatedAt=1795518390\"/><figcaption>DEEP WATER SOUTH第6A期1房戶逾967萬獲自用客承接｜黃竹坑新盤</figcaption></figure><p>港島南岸第6A期「DEEP WATER SOUTH」旗下「MONT BLUE」今日（24日）再錄成交，涉及單位為第2C座36樓D室，實用面積342平方呎，屬1房連開放式廚房間隔，成交價967.5萬元，折合實用面積呎價約28,289元。 據發展商表示，新買家鍾情單位可享南法園林及特色主題設施景致，加上項目位處港鐵商場上蓋，往返港島核心商業區便捷，遂購入作自住用途。 「DEEP WATER SOUTH」開售迄今累沽217伙，合共套現逾40.3億元。 即睇黃竹坑港島南岸6A期MONT BLUE最新資訊 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:44:14.860477+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T11:06:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T01:17:19.672604+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:37:16.742185+00:00","content_hash":"94a81fcb2c284942f19863264bb3812c3a05a140ddb8e453fb36f79212953ac2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}